# Backend Architecture Rules

Use Python + FastAPI + Pydantic + SQLAlchemy + Alembic + Redis + Celery.

Layering:

```text
API Route -> Schema -> Service -> Repository -> Model
```

Rules:

- API routes stay thin.
- Services own business logic.
- Repositories own database access.
- Integrations own external API clients.
- Celery tasks orchestrate background work.
- Do not swallow exceptions silently.
- Do not log secrets.
